  "totalBlocks": 147,
  "translatedBlocks": 147,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1102f0d2c18f8f36",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Quick Desktop 和 Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP 生成受治理的报告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70fae04ad42efbc6",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick Desktop 为团队已在 Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP（FSx for ONTAP）上管理的文件提供受治理的 AI 辅助报告功能，将每周报告的准备时间从数小时缩短至数分钟。目前，生成这些报告每周需要耗费数小时的人工工作。团队反复阅读相同的文档，重新整理指标的格式，并将摘要复制到 Slack。领导者需要快速获得这些更新，但也需要能够信任每项指标、风险和建议背后的来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00d990aadcb4a1ff",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，你将使用 Amazon Quick Desktop、Amazon Quick 技能、Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP、Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）接入点以及 Slack，构建一个受治理的每周报告工作流。Amazon Quick Desktop 是一款原生桌面应用程序，可将 Amazon Quick 从浏览器扩展到用户的计算机上。它既提供网页版体验中由 AI 驱动的功能，也提供桌面端特有的功能，例如",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c632da44ec3c98bc",
      "translationZh": "后台处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "800a3fbef34bcd3d",
      "translationZh": "个人知识图谱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e329cce71a0b980c",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中，你将创建一个名为 Weekly Business Reporting Assistant 的技能。技能是一种可复用的工作流，可为 Amazon Quick 提供针对特定任务的指令，让用户每周都能通过一个触发短语启动相同的报告流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb15661fec899522",
      "translationZh": "该工作流将一组受治理的业务文件与引导式报告体验连接起来。它让源文档继续受到现有存储和访问控制的管理，仅允许 Amazon Quick 访问选定的报告内容，并在共享产出物或 Slack 摘要之前保留人工审核环节。示例使用的是虚构的业务数据，但这种模式也适用于运营评审、预测更新、风险报告、高管简报和每周业务评审。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e8d6088b0d70219",
      "translationZh": "此解决方案将 Amazon Quick Desktop 作为每周报告的主要工作空间。业务用户打开 Quick Desktop，启用 Weekly Business Reporting Assistant 技能，然后提出诸如“自上周的运营回顾以来，有哪些变化？”或“为领导层创建一份单页周报。”这样的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f93755d4ec9d398",
      "translationZh": "该技能使工作流程能够重复执行。它为 Amazon Quick 提供针对特定任务的指令，涵盖来源资料集、输出格式、引用方式以及何时请求澄清。这让用户能够从有引导的报告流程开始，而不是从空白对话开始。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "711be46b740e5a1c",
      "translationZh": "源文件仍保存在 FSx for ONTAP 中。在本演示中，FSx for ONTAP 存储支持每周报告的文档，例如最终版每周回顾、运营计划、预测摘要、风险登记册和高管模板。将文件保留在 FSx for ONTAP 中，让存储团队和业务团队能够继续使用现有的文件访问和治理流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f3c3c41931fb419",
      "translationZh": "你选择一个报告文件夹供助手使用。该文件夹包含业务负责人批准用于此工作流程的文件。草稿、过时文件、受限文档和无关内容均保留在此文件夹之外。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e68483031de8fe6",
      "translationZh": "S3 访问点为 Amazon Quick 提供对所选文件夹的受控读取访问权限。AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 权限限制了 Amazon Quick 可以列出和读取的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "125e1932d430eb73",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 使用所选文件创建一个可搜索的来源资料集，称为知识库。在本演示中，该知识库名为 Business Reporting Archive。Weekly Business Reporting Assistant 技能使用它来回答问题、引用源文档、创建报告、生成演示文稿和 PDF、构建可视化内容，以及起草可直接用于 Slack 的摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64aa80be1678df6e",
      "translationZh": "报告准备好分享后，你可以使用 Amazon Quick 中的 Slack 集成功能起草频道摘要。发布前，你需要审核并批准该消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8f8162039e6a536",
      "translationZh": "图 1 展示了该工作流程。业务文件保留在 FSx for ONTAP 中。S3 访问点为 Amazon Quick 提供对所选报告文件夹的受控访问权限。Amazon Quick 将这些内容整理为 Business Reporting Archive 知识库。用户在 Quick Desktop 中使用 Weekly Business Reporting Assistant 技能，创建带有来源引用的报告产物和待审批的 Slack 摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a4d40a6ef0c12f",
      "translationZh": "图 1：使用 Amazon Quick Desktop、Amazon Quick skills、Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP、Amazon S3 访问点和 Slack 的受治理的每周报告工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a864bf0bdf1c069",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick Desktop 还会在 My context 中构建个人知识图谱，将人员、项目、事件、行动和文档关联起来。例如，在准备每周报告时，用户可以从已连接的数据源中识别相关人员、待办事项、文档和 Slack 频道。Business Reporting Archive 仍是报告事实和引用的受治理来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a3c1097bc82e605",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Amazon Quick Desktop 的 My context 视图中的个人知识图谱示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57532615eefa6204",
      "translationZh": "本操作指南假定你的存储和身份基础设施已经就绪。你将配置访问路径、Amazon Quick 知识库、报告助手、Slack 操作连接器和验证工作流。你不会创建 FSx for ONTAP 文件系统本身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7a39ecd28aa42b9",
      "translationZh": "AWS 账户和 Amazon Quick 要求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2dde2001fb598004",
      "translationZh": "一个 AWS 账户，能够访问支持 Amazon Quick、Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP 以及适用于 FSx for ONTAP 的 Amazon S3 访问点的区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ef1eb5234b83d14",
      "translationZh": "一项 Amazon Quick Enterprise 订阅，并具有创建 Amazon S3 集成、知识库和空间的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9383777fdf5a1dde",
      "translationZh": "为运行报告工作流的用户安装 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序。在生产环境中部署之前，请查看企业设置要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f24d7f7177778a5",
      "translationZh": "FSx for ONTAP 要求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d04666b4be63d97",
      "translationZh": "一个运行 NetApp ONTAP 9.17.1 或更高版本的 FSx for ONTAP 文件系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e14053e54380231c",
      "translationZh": "一个已挂载且具有接合路径（例如 /business-reporting）的 FSx for ONTAP 卷。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06c50e8e11f008e2",
      "translationZh": "一个已关联到 FSx for ONTAP 卷的 S3 接入点，或创建该接入点的权限。S3 接入点和 FSx for ONTAP 卷必须位于同一 AWS 区域，并归同一 AWS 账户所有。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ace05045192f6fff",
      "translationZh": "具备 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 权限，以便授予 Amazon Quick 对 S3 接入点和已批准对象前缀的最小权限读取访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c775d63b28e61d76",
      "translationZh": "一个与您的 Amazon Quick 应用程序位于同一 AWS 区域的 Amazon S3 路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d617c74d4e62398",
      "translationZh": "Slack 和测试要求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c1b15a3eb40a8bc",
      "translationZh": "一个 Slack 工作区、一个用于发布经审核摘要的已批准频道，以及配置 Slack 操作连接器的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a0d94723b3a3d1c",
      "translationZh": "一组范围集中的虚构或已获批准的业务文件，用于测试，例如每周业务回顾、运营计划、预测摘要、风险登记册和高管模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf446f904d6198f7",
      "translationZh": "实施过程包含七个步骤。以下各节将逐一介绍：准备源文件夹、创建 S3 访问点、授予 Amazon Quick 读取权限、创建 Amazon S3 集成和知识库、配置 Slack、创建报告助手，以及测试工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0bdd988684c8ed65",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：准备源内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cd8d07fe91a2b39",
      "translationZh": "首先将文件夹范围限定在较小范围内，以便业务用户能够依据一组已知的源文件核实引用。在本演练中，使用一个已挂载的 FSx for ONTAP 卷，并创建或选择一个已获批准的文件夹，例如 /business-reporting。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bd89eaa0fcfa080",
      "translationZh": "在该文件夹内，围绕报告流程组织文件。添加最近 8–12 次每周业务回顾、当前运营计划、当前预测摘要和当前风险登记册。同时添加用于指导输出风格的标准报告模板。在建立索引之前，移除草稿、过时文件、归档文件和受限文件，并确认文件所有者认可源文件的范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "663f5a26c9c7b915",
      "translationZh": "图 3：已挂载的 FSx for ONTAP 卷上已获批准的报告文件夹结构示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1f2145d936ce1a6",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：创建 S3 访问点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d8d58d22fed87a4",
      "translationZh": "将一个 S3 访问点关联到 FSx for ONTAP 卷。随后，Amazon Quick 就可以通过兼容 S3 的路径读取已获批准的内容。如果您不负责 FSx for ONTAP 配置，请与您的存储或云管理员协作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be27b349abb09f68",
      "translationZh": "在包含 FSx for ONTAP 卷的区域中打开 Amazon FSx 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03318213708549ce",
      "translationZh": "在导航窗格中，选择 Volumes（卷）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24024952c0371b8e",
      "translationZh": "选择已挂载且包含已批准的报告文件夹的 FSx for ONTAP 卷。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f91b2998ff052b93",
      "translationZh": "从 Actions（操作）中选择 Create S3 access point（创建 S3 访问点）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc5d7f95ba67e342",
      "translationZh": "输入符合您的命名标准的访问点名称，例如 business-reporting-ap。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec3b1e02d16980b6",
      "translationZh": "根据您的治理模型配置访问点用户和网络设置。如果您的工作负载需要通过私有网络访问，请选择虚拟私有云限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7f11a287dde8e42",
      "translationZh": "创建访问点，然后记录访问点别名和 Amazon Resource Name (ARN)。在 S3 URI 中使用该别名，在 IAM 策略中使用该 ARN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "217b3daaf9c2efd6",
      "translationZh": "图 4：FSx for ONTAP 数据源的 S3 访问点概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9dbed3f3662c625d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：授予 Amazon Quick 读取权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d921cfad7421b78a",
      "translationZh": "仅授予 Amazon Quick 列出和读取已批准前缀所需的权限。以下策略可作为起点。请将占位符替换为您的区域、账户 ID、访问点名称和前缀。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3462b28cec4b58d2",
      "translationZh": "将 <access-point-arn> 设置为 arn:aws:s3:<region>:<account-id>:accesspoint/<access-point-name>。将 <approved-prefix-object-arn> 设置为 arn:aws:s3:<region>:<account-id>:accesspoint/<access-point-name>/object/business-reporting/*。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "effa87846481703f",
      "translationZh": "确定 Amazon Quick 在您的账户中进行 Amazon S3 集成时使用的 IAM 角色或服务角色。将该策略附加到此角色，并授予对 Amazon S3 集成所需的文档级访问控制列表（ACL）或元数据文件的读取权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11b0e3efeb0fdcf4",
      "translationZh": "在配置 Amazon S3 集成之前，请验证访问点别名和前缀。确认该角色无法读取已批准的报告前缀之外的文件夹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbf0ed0e8bfb9d19",
      "translationZh": "图 5：包含 S3 访问点权限的 IAM 策略编辑器示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1ef2918a48bdf794",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：创建 Amazon S3 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b7bb1cdbc513ca4",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 中创建 Amazon S3 集成，并使用该集成从已批准的前缀创建知识库。即使您使用的是 S3 访问点别名，控制台也可能将该路径标记为存储桶 URL。在发布助手之前，请在您的账户中验证别名路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1de507c85fb4f34f",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon Quick 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6ef9466dc6f2c74",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon S3 下，选择“添加”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a00be00151241e2e",
      "translationZh": "选择现有的 Amazon S3 数据源，或选择“+ 添加账户”以连接新的数据源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e12115953d08786",
      "translationZh": "在“名称”中，输入 FSx ONTAP Business Reports。在 S3 位置中，输入访问点别名路径，例如 s3:///amzn-s3-demo-business-reporting/。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46a5b5442b896157",
      "translationZh": "在知识库页面上，输入 FSx ONTAP Business Reports 作为知识库名称。仅选择已获批准的前缀。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c219774055f46f97",
      "translationZh": "知识库同步完成后，在 Amazon Quick 控制台中打开“空间”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20358d84ad73f340",
      "translationZh": "创建一个名为 Business Reporting Archive 的新空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51b3406592bb40dd",
      "translationZh": "将 FSx ONTAP Business Reports 知识库添加到此空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68b589ab55d895eb",
      "translationZh": "如果你的报告文件需要按用户或按组设置权限，请先配置文档级 ACL 和元数据设置。Amazon Quick 要求你在创建知识库时确定 ACL 设置。选择 Create 后，请等待首次同步完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9d2de486e3f9f8b",
      "translationZh": "图 6：从已批准的 S3 访问点路径创建的 Amazon Quick 知识库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "94bf5babbf858b95",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：配置 Slack",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80a5889e2299c9b7",
      "translationZh": "配置 Slack，以便助手能够暂存业务摘要，供审核并发布到已批准的频道。请选择符合你所在组织安全要求的身份验证方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "887e0ce8936ad4d3",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 控制台中，选择 Connectors。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee63581c36cea7eb",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序中，选择 Settings，选择 Capabilities，选择 Connections，然后选择 Browse Connections。这将打开 Amazon Quick Web 控制台，以完成连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e526c58ac125983",
      "translationZh": "在 Available 选项卡上，找到 Slack 并选择 Connect。对于由团队管理的应用或基于令牌的配置，请使用 Create for your team 选项卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "095fdbd79e5cd776",
      "translationZh": "完成 Slack 登录或令牌流程，并仅授予必要的权限。使用所需的最小 Slack OAuth 权限范围（例如，将 chat:write 的权限限定于已批准的频道），并按规定的时间计划轮换凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee12fdc574ba707a",
      "translationZh": "如果您的组织要求对连接器进行审批，请与您的 Amazon Quick 管理员协作，将 Slack 连接器发布给您的用户或用户组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8643de1c6f79e14d",
      "translationZh": "确认已获批准的 Slack 频道，例如 #finance-weekly，并在发布消息前记录哪些人有权审批消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc1d117482ac6993",
      "translationZh": "返回桌面应用程序，在使用 Slack 进行每周报告之前，先在非生产频道中使用消息草稿进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e9869aba936a44d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 6：创建报告助手",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eed76469f2f88c82",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序中创建一项自定义技能，用于加载 Business Reporting Archive 空间并应用报告防护规则。该技能提供一个可复用的助手，用户可以通过触发短语将其激活。有关技能编写的更多信息，请参阅 Amazon Quick 技能编写文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e1537c37683dc9e",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序中，打开一个对话，并输入如下所示的精简技能规范。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82780b88d8b722ba",
      "translationZh": "将该技能命名为 Weekly Business Reporting Assistant，并设置一个触发短语，例如 weekly business report。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0adb0354864ed232",
      "translationZh": "保存该技能，并确认它会加载 Business Reporting Archive 空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "842a41e45635fe5d",
      "translationZh": "图 7：在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中输入报告助手技能规范",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3da92e15d1fce4e",
      "translationZh": "图 8：Amazon Quick 在保存助手之前建议技能默认设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f0688f11f5b396c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 7：将 Amazon Quick Desktop 用作报告工作区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e0883cc66e0e619",
      "translationZh": "创建技能后，在 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序的对话中激活它。以下示例展示了一位业务用户如何从提出问题，到获得附有引用的报告，再到获得经过审核的 Slack 摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c495a58ab1c03d1",
      "translationZh": "开始新对话并输入触发短语，例如：我需要业务报告方面的帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84f8f075954d002a",
      "translationZh": "该技能加载 Business Reporting Archive 空间，并以示例问题向你问好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "500835f291fd6c2f",
      "translationZh": "图 9：在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中激活的报告助手",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "321f7a7eabc8ebf2",
      "translationZh": "输入报告请求，例如：自上次运营评审以来发生了哪些变化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "756dd1f38a8f426e",
      "translationZh": "图 10：根据 Business Reporting Archive 生成的周环比变化分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d920a74a690b8dd7",
      "translationZh": "使用回复前，请先审查所引用的发现。Amazon Quick Desktop 会显示来源详情和回复步骤，让你能够核查回复所依据的文档和日期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac296e9211776744",
      "translationZh": "图 11：每周报告回复中引用的关键进展和行动事项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bce8597d6e34ba6",
      "translationZh": "图 12：供在使用回复前审查的回复步骤和来源详情",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04ea17e486666b6a",
      "translationZh": "让 Amazon Quick 根据所引用的洞察创建每周报告、PowerPoint 演示文稿、PDF 或面向高管的可视化内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe6dea3c0c3757f3",
      "translationZh": "审查拟议的计划，必要时提出修改建议，并在计划准备就绪后选择 Approve & Build。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b31ca5d0ff8b110",
      "translationZh": "图 13：在 Amazon Quick 构建产出物之前，准备好供审查的报告创建计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f552149e5f88058",
      "translationZh": "批准计划后，Amazon Quick 会按所请求的格式创建该内容资产。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26cb5f46f664d924",
      "translationZh": "图 14：在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中生成的周报产物",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b75e1dca2ccb63a",
      "translationZh": "让 Amazon Quick Desktop 为获准使用的频道起草一份 Slack 摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "043179d7344ed080",
      "translationZh": "在对话中审阅草稿，并且只有在草稿已准备好发布时才予以确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12a68a8c9b2a420f",
      "translationZh": "图 15：已准备好发布到 Slack、在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中等待批准的报告摘要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3febbce110e3eac6",
      "translationZh": "图 16：已获批准的周报摘要发布到 Slack 测试频道",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f39028cbd06f6ee2",
      "translationZh": "使用业务提示词测试工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38e7932f08edb7a4",
      "translationZh": "保存技能后，使用符合实际周报工作的提示词来验证端到端工作流。每条回复都必须引用具体的源文档，在生成的产物中包含来源列表，并在发布到 Slack 之前请求你的确认。下表列出了具有代表性的提示词，以及检查回复时应关注的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed2817de5baafd72",
      "translationZh": "与上一次运营评审相比，最重要的五项变化是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c743d1ef57c88ff2",
      "translationZh": "一份附有引用的摘要，包含来源文档和日期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae714120d6f16abc",
      "translationZh": "最近四次每周业务回顾中，哪些风险反复出现？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b77decb1e41e47c",
      "translationZh": "按类别整理风险并附上引用；如果来源文档中包含建议负责人，也一并列出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20103c30c113e498",
      "translationZh": "创建一份单页周报，包含亮点、风险、行动项、请求、关键指标以及需要作出的决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f04d243e8ffdbec1",
      "translationZh": "一份结构化报告，其中的论述附有引用，并包含来源列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dd2525fd98c011f",
      "translationZh": "根据最新的回顾和运营计划，为领导层制作一份六页的 PowerPoint 演示文稿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "562fc55a29ac9adb",
      "translationZh": "一份演示文稿或演示文稿大纲，包含标题、摘要、亮点、风险、决策和来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e25493eaef8ce9b3",
      "translationZh": "创建一份包含六个要点的 Slack 摘要，并在发布前征求我的同意。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d416e12c15703aa",
      "translationZh": "一条已准备好发送到 Slack 的消息，正等待发布前审批。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3526a2d3377f4b8e",
      "translationZh": "安全与治理最佳实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498f724e9f0cba04",
      "translationZh": "分阶段从示例工作流过渡到共享报告工作流。先从一个已批准的文件夹路径开始，在业务用户验证引用质量后再扩大范围。使源文件权限与你现有的 FSx for ONTAP 治理模型保持一致，并为 Amazon Quick 用于读取 S3 访问点的角色配置遵循最小权限原则的 IAM 权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a70b010eacbb086",
      "translationZh": "当知识库需要按用户或用户组实施访问控制时，在 Amazon S3 集成中使用文档级 ACL。使用专用的 Slack 频道发布报告摘要，明确谁可以批准发布，并要求对董事会材料、监管相关内容、投资者沟通内容或敏感财务报告进行人工审核。定期检查已建立索引的源文件，并从已批准的文件夹路径中移除过时内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edfe4471855afe91",
      "translationZh": "参阅下表，诊断常见的设置和运行时问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45c328cf7ebcd422",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 无法读取源路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9380c6d5366ba41d",
      "translationZh": "确认 S3 访问点别名、同一区域要求、IAM 策略的资源范围以及 Amazon Quick 服务角色权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03fdb563f78c18fb",
      "translationZh": "知识库同步失败",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30a5d8c98d4eff44",
      "translationZh": "确认已批准的前缀存在，接入点已关联到已挂载的 FSx for ONTAP 卷，并且文件系统正在运行 NetApp ONTAP 9.17.1 或更高版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "810d20aefefefbd9",
      "translationZh": "回答不包含引用来源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ab189f6658a15cf",
      "translationZh": "确认 Business Reporting Archive 空间已在 Amazon Quick Desktop 中连接，并且知识库文件已成功同步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03591a5be0e910f7",
      "translationZh": "回答引用了旧文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2d671459873c1a6",
      "translationZh": "确认知识库同步状态，并从已批准的文件夹路径中移除过时文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a793ca5dd8da80d1",
      "translationZh": "确认 Slack 连接器的授权、频道访问权限、所需的权限范围，以及该连接器是否已发布给用户或群组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "247ad1e4f4a4f7be",
      "translationZh": "为避免后续产生费用或留下未使用的访问路径，请仅移除您为本演练创建或更改的资源。这些步骤将撤销前面各节中对 Amazon Quick 知识库、Slack 操作连接器、S3 接入点和 IAM 策略所做的更改。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b419d8641101ec65",
      "translationZh": "如果不再需要 Weekly Business Reporting Assistant 技能，请将其从 Amazon Quick 桌面应用程序中删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b19eee2c0bc380c1",
      "translationZh": "如果 Business Reporting Archive 知识库仅为本文而创建，请将其删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db5fa6b8fe646b75",
      "translationZh": "如果没有其他知识库使用该 Amazon S3 集成，请将其从 Amazon Quick 中移除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e05b5a41f379b34",
      "translationZh": "如果该 S3 接入点仅为此工作流而创建，且没有其他工作负载使用它，请将其删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffcb0983388b7c85",
      "translationZh": "移除仅为本操作演练而添加的 IAM 策略语句和接入点策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "973b6877427278a5",
      "translationZh": "如果示例文件仅用于测试，请将其从已批准的文件夹路径中移除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92ef9174655e6bae",
      "translationZh": "现在，你已经拥有一个受治理的每周报告工作流，可根据存储在 Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP 上的文件内容，创建带有引用的业务成果。S3 接入点仅开放已批准的文件夹路径，而 Amazon Quick 通过 Amazon S3 集成为这些内容建立索引。业务用户可以在同一个工作区中研究报告相关问题、生成报告和可视化内容，并准备 Slack 摘要，而无需将源文件移出受管理的存储工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb4ec3a81cc4943f",
      "translationZh": "对于高管和业务利益相关者，这种模式能够提升他们对定期更新内容的信任。用户在使用输出内容之前会核查引用，并在 Slack 帖子发布之前进行审批。对于构建者，这种模式将首次实施的范围控制在足够小的程度，以便验证治理、访问权限和报告质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47914b7c587afd5b",
      "translationZh": "从一个已批准的文件夹、一个报告用例和一个经过审核的分发渠道开始。在用户信任引用和输出质量之后，将知识库扩展到更多业务部门，按需添加文档级 ACL，并根据内部报告标准完善技能指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76361d166182ea97",
      "translationZh": "首先，在你的 FSx for ONTAP 卷上确定一个已获批准的报告文件夹，并与你的存储团队合作，为该路径创建一个 S3 访问点。然后创建 Amazon Quick 知识库和报告助手技能，并用你的第一份每周更新验证该工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c80ce9f9afba1174",
      "translationZh": "有关更多信息，请参阅以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
